{"title": "[花邊] Bam Adebayo：你們就等著看吧", "author": "SeanLi1013 (TrunksHOPE)", "board": "", "date": "Tue Oct 27 11:14:40 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793070883.A.477.html", "body": "https://x.com/zachweinberger/status/2114914343016169799\n\nAsked Bam Adebayo about his struggles and if it’s because he’s still learnin\ng how to play with Giannis: #Heat\n\n“No, can't overthink basketball, man. For me, my shot not going in. I'm not n\not gonna overthink that. You know, it's funny how the outside noise wants to m\nake me the scapegoat. But when the tables turn, just all that energy, when the\n energy shifts, just be prepared for that.”\n\n我問了Bam Adebayo，談到他近期的低迷表現，以及這是否因為他仍在學習如何與Giannis\n\n搭檔打球。\n\nAdebayo回答：\n\n「不，老兄，打籃球不能想得太多。對我來說，就是我的投籃沒投進，我不會因此想太多\n\n。你知道嗎？有趣的是，外界的雜音總是想把我塑造成代罪羔羊。\n\n但等到情勢逆轉時，當所有人的風向都變了，當輿論的態度開始轉變時，你們就等著看吧\n\n。」\n\nhttps://x.com/zachweinberger/status/2114915189980111255\n\nAsked Bam Adebayo about him saying that the outside noise has been using him a\ns the scapegoat and why he thinks that is: #Heat\n\n“I got expectations for myself, but, obviously, the outside noise got expecta\ntions for us. So for me, I know what I'm capable of. I'm not gonna overthink t\nhat. We’re 0-4 right now. I'd rather it be right now than this be midway thro\nugh the season or in April. Because what if we go on a 10 game winning streak.\n Then how does the noise change?”\n\n我問了Bam Adebayo，關於他提到外界一直把他當成代罪羔羊一事，以及他為什麼認為會\n\n出現這種情況。\n\nAdebayo表示：\n\n「我對自己有一定的期望，但顯然，外界也對我們有他們的期望。\n\n所以對我來說，我很清楚自己有什麼實力，我不會因此想太多。我們目前的戰績是0勝4敗\n\n。\n\n我寧願現在就遇到這種情況，也不想等到賽季進行到一半，或是到了四月才面對這些問題\n\n。\n\n因為，假如我們接下來打出一波十連勝，那麼外界的風向又會變成怎樣呢？」\n\n———\n不愧是83哥心態真是強大\n\nhttps://i.mopix.cc/e070NW.jpg", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "xjapan329", "content": "看破手腳嗎XD", "time": "10/27 11:14"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "UD305", "content": "先不要", "time": "10/27 11:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "jorden", "content": "好我等著看100分!", "time": "10/27 11:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "pokemon", "content": "正在看 怎麼了嗎", "time"